Investigate retry backoff and reconcile loop.
Related decision: see k9m2 for claim strategy.
## SPEC [3fa9] Workload execution retry semantics
Decisions: k9m2, docs/adr/0034-enrichment-stage.md
Retries are bounded exponential backoff, capped at 5 attempts.
A retry consumes the same claim; it never re-acquires it.
Failures after the cap transition the workitem to blocked, never done.
